sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Customer
  participant B as Browser (booking.js)
  participant W as Worker API
  participant D as D1 database
  participant O as Owner (4Guard)

  C->>B: Taps "Cockroaches" on the home page
  B->>B: Steps 1-3 (answers saved in sessionStorage)
  alt Not signed in
    C->>B: Step 4: name, email, password
    B->>W: POST /api/auth/signup
    W->>D: insert user, insert session
    W-->>B: Set-Cookie (HttpOnly session)
  end
  B->>W: POST /api/bookings
  W->>W: Validate against catalog.js and dates
  W->>D: insert booking with reference 4G-XXXXXX
  W-->>B: 201 { reference }
  B-->>C: "Booking request sent" + reference

  O->>W: GET /api/bookings?status=PENDING
  W-->>O: Waiting bookings
  O->>W: PATCH /api/bookings/:id (CONFIRMED, date, note)
  W->>D: update status, schedule, note
  C->>W: GET /api/bookings (account page)
  W-->>C: Confirmed + date + "how to prepare" note
  C->>W: POST /api/messages "Can you come earlier?"
  O->>W: POST /api/admin/messages (reply)
